(7552345, 1210259, 86447, '<td valign="top">Am I going blind, Mark, or is the focus on the wall and not your face?<br/> <br/>Interesting...</td>', 'Am I going blind, Mark, or is the focus on the wall and not your face? Interesting...', '2018-01-12 11:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552347, 1209990, 86447, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful portrait!</td>', 'What a beautiful portrait!', '2018-01-12 11:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552348, 1209904, 86447, '<td valign="top">Tessa is adorable.</td>', 'Tessa is adorable.', '2018-01-12 11:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552349, 1210246, 86447, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit washed out... but I love the portrait other than that.</td>', 'Seems a bit washed out... but I love the portrait other than that.', '2018-01-12 11:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552351, 1210055, 86447, '<td valign="top">Whoa... such a great smile for such a cold day!</td>', 'Whoa... such a great smile for such a cold day!', '2018-01-12 11:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552355, 1210248, 86447, '<td valign="top">That face!  I love it in any light.<br/> <br/>Wish I could see his eyes... but I''m on a borrowed monitor that''s not calibrated, so they''re probably visible to others.  *sigh*</td>', 'That face!  I love it in any light. Wish I could see his eyes... but I''m on a borrowed monitor that''s not calibrated, so they''re probably visible to others.  *sigh*', '2018-01-12 11:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552358, 1210254, 86447, '<td valign="top">Great focus and light.  The crop seems a bit... ummm... "crowded" to me though.   Love all of the other stuff!</td>', 'Great focus and light.  The crop seems a bit... ummm... "crowded" to me though.   Love all of the other stuff!', '2018-01-12 11:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552359, 1210204, 86447, '<td valign="top">Hi, Phil!   Nicely done.</td>', 'Hi, Phil!   Nicely done.', '2018-01-12 11:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552360, 1210069, 86447, '<td valign="top">Fabulous light!   I love the pose and how you didn''t overly smooth her skin. <br/> <br/>On my borrowed monitor, her right eye is so washed out, it''s disconcerting to me... like she doesn''t have an iris and pupil.  I hope others can see it.   I''ll not vote.</td>', 'Fabulous light!   I love the pose and how you didn''t overly smooth her skin.  On my borrowed monitor, her right eye is so washed out, it''s disconcerting to me... like she doesn''t have an iris and pupil.  I hope others can see it.   I''ll not vote.', '2018-01-12 11:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552361, 1209911, 86447, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t call this a "Portrait" and that might be messing with your votes.   But, I like it... just not in this challenge topic.   I''ll not vote.</td>', 'I wouldn''t call this a "Portrait" and that might be messing with your votes.   But, I like it... just not in this challenge topic.   I''ll not vote.', '2018-01-12 11:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552362, 1210256, 86447, '<td valign="top">To me, a portrait means that a person knows he/she is modeling/sitting for you.   So, I''m not sure this works in my definition.  I hope others have a different one.  :D</td>', 'To me, a portrait means that a person knows he/she is modeling/sitting for you.   So, I''m not sure this works in my definition.  I hope others have a different one.  :D', '2018-01-12 11:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
