(7552366, 1210258, 86447, '<td valign="top">An interesting choice for a portrait of someone... with the person being blurred and the cars in focus.  <br/> <br/>I''ll be interested to see how this scores for you.</td>', 'An interesting choice for a portrait of someone... with the person being blurred and the cars in focus.   I''ll be interested to see how this scores for you.', '2018-01-12 11:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
