(7552931, 1209837, 138630, '<td valign="top">My favorite in the contest.  I love the light and especially that it touches her face and eyes as well as that gorgeous wavy hair.  Lovely focus and expression.</td>', 'My favorite in the contest.  I love the light and especially that it touches her face and eyes as well as that gorgeous wavy hair.  Lovely focus and expression.', '2018-01-16 10:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552932, 1210069, 138630, '<td valign="top">I want just a bit more depth of field - better focus and maybe a tad less light on her right eye.  Gave this a 9 but really wanted to give it a 10.</td>', 'I want just a bit more depth of field - better focus and maybe a tad less light on her right eye.  Gave this a 9 but really wanted to give it a 10.', '2018-01-16 10:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552934, 1209978, 138630, '<td valign="top">I wish he looked more comfortable.  Perhaps it''s his strained (to my eye) facial expression or the awkward (again, to me) position of his left hand; maybe it''s the tilt that makes it feel off balance; whatever it is, he does not look as if he is enjoying anything.  I gave it an 8 because I really do love the light, color, and depth of field.</td>', 'I wish he looked more comfortable.  Perhaps it''s his strained (to my eye) facial expression or the awkward (again, to me) position of his left hand; maybe it''s the tilt that makes it feel off balance; whatever it is, he does not look as if he is enjoying anything.  I gave it an 8 because I really do love the light, color, and depth of field.', '2018-01-16 10:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552943, 1210219, 138630, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail.  I''m not a fan of having the "back" eye that soft, but I love that the light is fully on the "front" one where the focus is sharp.  Even there, though, I could use a little more dof.</td>', 'Very nice detail.  I''m not a fan of having the "back" eye that soft, but I love that the light is fully on the "front" one where the focus is sharp.  Even there, though, I could use a little more dof.', '2018-01-16 10:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552944, 1210085, 138630, '<td valign="top">Absolutely lovely light and color except the whites of his eyes have a blue cast to my eye.  Maybe a slight adjustment?  Christmas tree still up? :)</td>', 'Absolutely lovely light and color except the whites of his eyes have a blue cast to my eye.  Maybe a slight adjustment?  Christmas tree still up? :)', '2018-01-16 10:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7552946, 1209990, 138630, '<td valign="top">The lighting may be appropriate for the expression - or vice versa - but I would love to have more light in the eyes.  Lovely girl, tones, and focus.</td>', 'The lighting may be appropriate for the expression - or vice versa - but I would love to have more light in the eyes.  Lovely girl, tones, and focus.', '2018-01-16 10:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
