(7553139, 1210069, 30861, '<td valign="top">Flawless in so many ways, but something very weird is going on with her right, OOF eye... It''s as if the eye''s white is the same tone as the skin, so there''s like a blinder or a wall there, a physical obstruction, very jarring to me :-(</td>', 'Flawless in so many ways, but something very weird is going on with her right, OOF eye... It''s as if the eye''s white is the same tone as the skin, so there''s like a blinder or a wall there, a physical obstruction, very jarring to me :-(', '2018-01-17 17:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
