(7553253, 1210248, 103142, '<td valign="top">I wish you hadn''t done such a gritty processing on this funny looking guy. It takes away from the lighting. Great portrait, but not helped by the processing. <br/> <br/>(hi!!! :)</td>', 'I wish you hadn''t done such a gritty processing on this funny looking guy. It takes away from the lighting. Great portrait, but not helped by the processing.  (hi!!! :)', '2018-01-18 13:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
