(7553255, 1210207, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is awesome -- but it seems underexposed...</td>', 'This is awesome -- but it seems underexposed...', '2018-01-18 13:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553256, 1210256, 173844, '<td valign="top">This slightly blurred, grainy portrait is quite moving.  Emotions both bubble over and simmer within.  I don'' know what his actual emotions are, but most prominent to my eye, due to visage and mien, is that of deep concern.  The disposition of tones is wonderful.  That he''s about to exit the frame conveys a sense of urgency and diffidence.  The beautifully picked out sliding lock above his left hand further suggests an atmosphere of being closed off.  It''s kabuki.  The upper right corner is somewhat distracting, but so it goes.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'This slightly blurred, grainy portrait is quite moving.  Emotions both bubble over and simmer within.  I don'' know what his actual emotions are, but most prominent to my eye, due to visage and mien, is that of deep concern.  The disposition of tones is wonderful.  That he''s about to exit the frame conveys a sense of urgency and diffidence.  The beautifully picked out sliding lock above his left hand further suggests an atmosphere of being closed off.  It''s kabuki.  The upper right corner is somewhat distracting, but so it goes.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2018-01-18 13:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553258, 1210248, 173844, '<td valign="top">A terrific portrait beautifully set off by exciting and moody processing.  There is tension between the overall grit and the milder portrait, genial and kind-eyed.  There''s even a halo effect going on.  The time of day and the weather are active participants in the image.  You''ve nailed a keen, provocative style.<br/>Personal second favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'A terrific portrait beautifully set off by exciting and moody processing.  There is tension between the overall grit and the milder portrait, genial and kind-eyed.  There''s even a halo effect going on.  The time of day and the weather are active participants in the image.  You''ve nailed a keen, provocative style.Personal second favorite of the challenge.', '2018-01-18 14:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553259, 1210261, 173844, '<td valign="top">A delightful high-key image.  The portrait of the dog is stellar, full of personality and beautifully posed.  The composition is also really fine, his/her head turned in towards the center, echoed by the arm of the bench.  I like how the paws and body dimple the fabric, conveying the sensation of weight.  The background is nicely neutral without being boringly formless.<br/>Personal third favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'A delightful high-key image.  The portrait of the dog is stellar, full of personality and beautifully posed.  The composition is also really fine, his/her head turned in towards the center, echoed by the arm of the bench.  I like how the paws and body dimple the fabric, conveying the sensation of weight.  The background is nicely neutral without being boringly formless.Personal third favorite of the challenge.', '2018-01-18 14:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553277, 1210228, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine intense portrait.  He looks coiled and ready.  Was he ok with being photographed?  His turban (not sure of the proper name) seems out of character, pretty and jaunty.  As a matter of fact he kind or looks like Sean Connery.  The people in the background seem to be casually clothed --  are they tourists?   I''m posing all these annoying questions because I''m confused, but in the end that doesn''t take away my fascination with his challenging, direct, powerful gaze.</td>', 'Fine intense portrait.  He looks coiled and ready.  Was he ok with being photographed?  His turban (not sure of the proper name) seems out of character, pretty and jaunty.  As a matter of fact he kind or looks like Sean Connery.  The people in the background seem to be casually clothed --  are they tourists?   I''m posing all these annoying questions because I''m confused, but in the end that doesn''t take away my fascination with his challenging, direct, powerful gaze.', '2018-01-18 21:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553280, 1210085, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine portrait of this lad in a wondering moment.  There are no curtains here, just a crystalline honesty.  I like the depth of focus here and, of course, the beautiful circular bokeh.  The composition is very pleasing.</td>', 'Fine portrait of this lad in a wondering moment.  There are no curtains here, just a crystalline honesty.  I like the depth of focus here and, of course, the beautiful circular bokeh.  The composition is very pleasing.', '2018-01-18 21:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553282, 1210217, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting how his head seems to float free of his body.  He looks to be a swami, if I may be so bold as to assert.  His face tells of a life lived with strength and determination.  I like the subtle tones and how he fills the frame.  Makes me realize how little I know of the world.</td>', 'Interesting how his head seems to float free of his body.  He looks to be a swami, if I may be so bold as to assert.  His face tells of a life lived with strength and determination.  I like the subtle tones and how he fills the frame.  Makes me realize how little I know of the world.', '2018-01-18 21:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553284, 1210080, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely movement and composition.  This woman seems serene and unconcerned with the cold.  I like how well the featureless whites tie the image together while also helping to make the cold tangible for the viewer.  The up-tilting overhang is a nice touch in the framing.  Fine photograph.</td>', 'Lovely movement and composition.  This woman seems serene and unconcerned with the cold.  I like how well the featureless whites tie the image together while also helping to make the cold tangible for the viewer.  The up-tilting overhang is a nice touch in the framing.  Fine photograph.', '2018-01-18 21:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553285, 1210174, 173844, '<td valign="top">Without the title I may not have appreciated the tenderness.  Goes to show how open one always should be.  The tilt works well for me, a nod to the casual and everyday.  I like how the tones shade from dark in the lower right through to bright in the upper left, a modest crescendo.  A very satisfying image.</td>', 'Without the title I may not have appreciated the tenderness.  Goes to show how open one always should be.  The tilt works well for me, a nod to the casual and everyday.  I like how the tones shade from dark in the lower right through to bright in the upper left, a modest crescendo.  A very satisfying image.', '2018-01-18 21:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553286, 1209990, 173844, '<td valign="top">Her beautiful face is well brought out from the softer surroundings.  She seems older than her years.  Maybe it''s her brow that''s somewhat knitted.  A lovely, successful portrait.</td>', 'Her beautiful face is well brought out from the softer surroundings.  She seems older than her years.  Maybe it''s her brow that''s somewhat knitted.  A lovely, successful portrait.', '2018-01-18 21:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553300, 1210069, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very nice offhand portrait, though my guess is that it''s posed.  She has a pleasant, dreamy look, kind of like Vermeer''s "Girl Withe a Pearl Earring."  I like how she''s lit from the back and left, leaving the illusion that we''re privy to a peek behind the brilliance.  The composition is quite nice, filling the frame and offering a dark natural border.  Fine image.</td>', 'Very nice offhand portrait, though my guess is that it''s posed.  She has a pleasant, dreamy look, kind of like Vermeer''s "Girl Withe a Pearl Earring."  I like how she''s lit from the back and left, leaving the illusion that we''re privy to a peek behind the brilliance.  The composition is quite nice, filling the frame and offering a dark natural border.  Fine image.', '2018-01-18 23:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553301, 1209837, 97225, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous hair! And it makes such a pretty frame for her pretty face.</td>', 'Gorgeous hair! And it makes such a pretty frame for her pretty face.', '2018-01-18 23:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553302, 1210069, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2018-01-18 23:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553303, 1210187, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait, nicely composed.</td>', 'Lovely portrait, nicely composed.', '2018-01-18 23:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553304, 1210243, 97225, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!</td>', 'Gorgeous!', '2018-01-18 23:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553305, 1210258, 173844, '<td valign="top">Within and without, the car and the storm, the parking lot away from the roads, his quiet demeanor and his inner drift.  Could be felt to be claustrophobic, but I, for one, am too drawn into the intimacy.  The composition is curiously balanced.  In a way he''s almost extraneous since the focus appears to be on the mirror.  A fine, fascinating image.</td>', 'Within and without, the car and the storm, the parking lot away from the roads, his quiet demeanor and his inner drift.  Could be felt to be claustrophobic, but I, for one, am too drawn into the intimacy.  The composition is curiously balanced.  In a way he''s almost extraneous since the focus appears to be on the mirror.  A fine, fascinating image.', '2018-01-18 23:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553307, 1210243, 173844, '<td valign="top">A sweet baby, all eyes.  There are your stars and galaxies.  So simply posed and composed, but has a compelling impact.  A beautiful heirloom.</td>', 'A sweet baby, all eyes.  There are your stars and galaxies.  So simply posed and composed, but has a compelling impact.  A beautiful heirloom.', '2018-01-18 23:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553308, 1210254, 173844, '<td valign="top">A fine study of this gentleman with a clear-eyed gaze.  He seems just about to say something, to continue a thought, a conversation that began before the button was depressed.  He also has an elfin quality.  That''s a lot to convey in a portrait of an instant, and it''s well accomplished.</td>', 'A fine study of this gentleman with a clear-eyed gaze.  He seems just about to say something, to continue a thought, a conversation that began before the button was depressed.  He also has an elfin quality.  That''s a lot to convey in a portrait of an instant, and it''s well accomplished.', '2018-01-18 23:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553309, 1210232, 173844, '<td valign="top">She seems really comfortable in her skin, and her environment.  It''s as if she''s deferring to the hills and the grassy plain.  Her face is nicely lit in shadow.  Lovely image.  I want to know what she''s looking at.</td>', 'She seems really comfortable in her skin, and her environment.  It''s as if she''s deferring to the hills and the grassy plain.  Her face is nicely lit in shadow.  Lovely image.  I want to know what she''s looking at.', '2018-01-18 23:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553310, 1210262, 173844, '<td valign="top">Hopefully he''s napping or resting, nothing more serious, for the mood is foreboding.  It''s interesting how he''s ensconced in the dark vee shadow, with the lighter triangle complementing his light face.  In fact, there are a lot of triangles in this fine image, so perhaps a gentle motif.  In the end I find it restful and I''m getting sleepy....</td>', 'Hopefully he''s napping or resting, nothing more serious, for the mood is foreboding.  It''s interesting how he''s ensconced in the dark vee shadow, with the lighter triangle complementing his light face.  In fact, there are a lot of triangles in this fine image, so perhaps a gentle motif.  In the end I find it restful and I''m getting sleepy....', '2018-01-18 23:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553311, 1209911, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautifully simple, graphically compelling.  It''s just the sky and a grassy hillside, but you add the grace notes of a tiny airplane to the left and a few observing people to the right, all in silhouette, and you''ve got an interesting and rather delightful image. Just add water?  Much more creative and imaginative it seems.  Good work.</td>', 'Beautifully simple, graphically compelling.  It''s just the sky and a grassy hillside, but you add the grace notes of a tiny airplane to the left and a few observing people to the right, all in silhouette, and you''ve got an interesting and rather delightful image. Just add water?  Much more creative and imaginative it seems.  Good work.', '2018-01-18 23:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553312, 1209977, 173844, '<td valign="top">Convincingly old-timey, but then she''s in a blue/purple down coat, a hundred years anachronistic.  Which makes the image fun and thought provoking.  Her face is beautifully lit by the sun.  Interesting image.</td>', 'Convincingly old-timey, but then she''s in a blue/purple down coat, a hundred years anachronistic.  Which makes the image fun and thought provoking.  Her face is beautifully lit by the sun.  Interesting image.', '2018-01-18 23:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553313, 1210259, 173844, '<td valign="top">His face is well picked out by the light streaming through the open door.  The entire foreground and background perfectly complement the man.  I like how the wide angle lens allows his hands to stretch so far forward and so far back, his arms like the wingspan of an albatross.  Then the look on his face is really interesting.  I can''t fathom it.  But this portrait is really fine.</td>', 'His face is well picked out by the light streaming through the open door.  The entire foreground and background perfectly complement the man.  I like how the wide angle lens allows his hands to stretch so far forward and so far back, his arms like the wingspan of an albatross.  Then the look on his face is really interesting.  I can''t fathom it.  But this portrait is really fine.', '2018-01-18 23:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553314, 1210187, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait, balanced, subtle and calm.  I like the well distributed tones and composition.</td>', 'Very nice portrait, balanced, subtle and calm.  I like the well distributed tones and composition.', '2018-01-18 23:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553315, 1209837, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait.  Blond never looked so good in black and white.  Well posed and beautifully lit.</td>', 'Very nice portrait.  Blond never looked so good in black and white.  Well posed and beautifully lit.', '2018-01-18 23:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553316, 1209774, 173844, '<td valign="top">Formal yet charming, due to the smile on her face.  Fine depth of field and with a pleasing background.  Very well handled.</td>', 'Formal yet charming, due to the smile on her face.  Fine depth of field and with a pleasing background.  Very well handled.', '2018-01-18 23:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7553317, 1210219, 173844, '<td valign="top">The title says it all, aside for the sweetness of the face.  If the camera could be drawn back we might see a favorite perch by the window.  I love that light.</td>', 'The title says it all, aside for the sweetness of the face.  If the camera could be drawn back we might see a favorite perch by the window.  I love that light.', '2018-01-18 23:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
