(7553485, 1209990, 102278, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by marnet:</b></div><hr/><i> I feel sorry for her </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Oh, don''t feel sorry for her Margaret, she''s an incredibly happy child - always laughing and smiling. She doesn''t like having her photo taken though so pretty much all my photos of her are when she''s daydreaming and thinking or scowling at the camera which I think gives a bit of a skewed view of her.</td>', 'Originally posted by marnet: I feel sorry for her   Oh, don''t feel sorry for her Margaret, she''s an incredibly happy child - always laughing and smiling. She doesn''t like having her photo taken though so pretty much all my photos of her are when she''s daydreaming and thinking or scowling at the camera which I think gives a bit of a skewed view of her.', '2018-01-20 11:21:34.000000', NULL, 0),
